</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/659a3e8c-e6e2-11f1-a088-ebb478925cf0/w:1024/p:16x9/om-1-2.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/659a3e8c-e6e2-11f1-a088-ebb478925cf0/w:1024/p:16x9/om-1-2.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d784c814-e6e2-11f1-96b4-cb663b72afc1</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:41:41 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>L'Equipe TV</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Live: Zelensky confirms Ukraine’s military struck Russian ships in Libyan waters</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261123-live-russian-strikes-kill-at-least-15-people-in-kyiv-region-ukraine-says</link><description>
