</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8c01efd6-e6d6-11f1-a5d3-6b451f569414/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261123-001051-001257-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8c01efd6-e6d6-11f1-a5d3-6b451f569414/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261123-001051-001257-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9229b506-e6d6-11f1-94e4-a1d5e3275a15</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:46:47 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>France's  far-right leader Le Pen denies receiving secrets from civil servant</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261123-france-s-far-right-leader-le-pen-denies-receiving-secrets-from-civil-servant</link><description>
